## About the standard

Part 2-1 specifies the security programme an asset owner must maintain for its IACS environment. The second edition (2024) structures requirements as SPE elements and introduces a maturity model.

Official source: [IEC 62443-2-1:2024](https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/62883).
